	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『Dr.スランプ アラレちゃん』より、オボッチャマンがFigure-rise Mechanicsに登場！",
			"• 内部構造から組み上げていくこだわりの工程で「本物」のオボッチャマンを作ることができる。",
			"• さまざまな表情を付けられるハンドパーツに加え、エネルギー源のロボビタンA、アラレちゃんの表情替え用「ほよよ顔」パーツが付属。",
			"• 別売りの「Figure-rise Mechanics アラレちゃん」と頭部の付け替えが可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Dr. Slump Arale-chan\", Obocchaman appears in Figure-rise Mechanics!",
			"• You can make a ``real'' Obocchaman using a meticulous process that starts with the internal structure.",
			"• In addition to hand parts that can be used to express various expressions, Robobitan A, the energy source, and a \"smiling face\" part for changing Arale's expressions are included.",
			"• The head can be replaced with \"Figure-rise Mechanics Arale-chan\" (sold separately)."
		]
	},
